              "text": "bibliopōla, bibliopōlae — \"a bookseller\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bibliopōla novōs librōs in tabernā vendit. The bookseller sells new books in his shop."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, first declension, from Greek biblion 'book' + pōlein 'to sell'."
            }
          ]
